WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.070
Episode 19

01:38.090 --> 01:39.960
I have nothing to do with Lin Gong's death.

01:39.980 --> 01:41.030
Why do they want to see me?

01:41.050 --> 01:42.370
I'm afraid

01:42.540 --> 01:44.730
you'll figure that out after seeing them.

01:45.370 --> 01:47.200
Then who should I see first?

01:48.940 --> 01:51.200
Prime Minister Lin Ruofu

01:51.730 --> 01:54.310
and the Crown Prince are not on the same side.

01:54.330 --> 01:55.750
Whoever you choose to see first,

01:55.770 --> 01:57.410
you'll offend the other one.

01:58.690 --> 01:59.630
Young Master Fan Xian,

01:59.650 --> 02:00.710
the imperial guards are here.

02:00.730 --> 02:02.850
His Majesty ordered to see you
through a verbal instruction.

02:03.010 --> 02:04.810
Now you don't have to choose.

02:07.820 --> 02:10.840
Hurry up! Don't keep His Majesty waiting.

02:22.730 --> 02:27.480
They have to meet after all.

02:49.060 --> 02:51.600
Mr. Fan, come with me.

02:51.620 --> 02:53.550
His Majesty is waiting for you.

02:53.570 --> 02:54.890
It's you again.

02:54.980 --> 02:55.960
It must be fate.

02:55.980 --> 02:57.200
Please.

02:59.490 --> 03:00.350
Eunuch Hou and I

03:00.370 --> 03:02.120
are somewhat connected.

03:02.340 --> 03:03.400
For my trial of beating Guo Baokun,

03:03.420 --> 03:04.780
you came to my rescue in the court of

03:04.780 --> 03:06.290
the Prefecture of Capital City.

03:06.290 --> 03:07.520
When I first arrived in the capital city,

03:07.540 --> 03:09.330
you were the one who drove my carriage.

03:09.700 --> 03:10.910
That is to say,

03:10.930 --> 03:12.320
you sent me to the Qing Temple

03:12.340 --> 03:13.830
on purpose.

03:13.850 --> 03:15.160
Mr. Fan,

03:15.180 --> 03:16.710
I've no idea

03:16.730 --> 03:18.240
what you're talking about.

03:18.260 --> 03:19.890
That's fine. I'll remember everything in heart.

03:21.650 --> 03:23.370
Eunuch Hou, this is for you to buy some tea.

03:23.370 --> 03:24.060
No! No!

03:24.060 --> 03:26.270
What are you doing?

03:26.290 --> 03:27.760
Madam Liu Ruyu of your family

03:27.780 --> 03:30.040
is a descendant of the Duke,

03:30.060 --> 03:31.880
and she used to visit the imperial palace frequently.

03:31.900 --> 03:34.320
I kind of watched her grow up.

03:34.340 --> 03:35.800
We are kind of related.

03:35.820 --> 03:37.490
How can I exploit a younger member of the family?

03:37.490 --> 03:38.650
I didn't know you're so connected

03:38.650 --> 03:40.120
with my family.

03:40.140 --> 03:41.270
Then as a younger member,

03:41.290 --> 03:42.600
I definitely should pay my respect.

03:42.620 --> 03:43.210
Well...

03:43.210 --> 03:44.630
It's not much.

03:44.650 --> 03:45.350
No.

03:45.370 --> 03:46.730
Well...

03:46.930 --> 03:49.090
I'm so flattered.

03:50.620 --> 03:53.450
Paying respect to rites and
carrying forward illustrious virtues,

03:53.490 --> 03:55.430
plus outstanding poetry talents,

03:55.450 --> 03:59.240
no wonder His Majesty often mentions you.

03:59.260 --> 04:00.890
Really?

04:01.140 --> 04:03.010
His Majesty really likes

04:03.010 --> 04:05.800
your seven-syllable poem with the line

04:05.820 --> 04:07.800
“A thousand miles from home,
I'm grieved at autumn's plight.”

04:07.820 --> 04:09.170
May I ask

04:09.260 --> 04:10.730
when His Majesty asked about me today,

04:10.730 --> 04:12.280
was he happy or angry?

04:13.420 --> 04:15.600
He looked calm

04:15.620 --> 04:17.440
with no sign of anger.

04:20.300 --> 04:22.040
Thanks for telling me.

04:23.090 --> 04:24.470
In that case,

04:24.490 --> 04:27.070
I'll tell you something else.

04:27.090 --> 04:29.210
His Majesty loves to make bows and arrows.

04:29.210 --> 04:30.610
Never touch

04:30.610 --> 04:33.880
those stuff.

04:43.820 --> 04:44.520
How come there's someone

04:44.540 --> 04:46.480
walking the high walls in the imperial palace?

04:47.420 --> 04:48.490
No one here dares do that

04:48.490 --> 04:50.190
for sure.

04:50.210 --> 04:52.090
Eunuch, I've seen that.

04:52.260 --> 04:53.870
He might be an assassinator.

04:53.890 --> 04:54.800
Please.

04:54.820 --> 04:56.120
Assassinator?

04:56.140 --> 04:57.350
Who will he assassinate?

04:57.370 --> 04:59.590
His Majesty, of course.

04:59.610 --> 05:01.350
Then should we call out for help?

05:01.370 --> 05:03.170
No need to worry.

05:03.170 --> 05:06.210
It's improper to call out loud.

05:06.210 --> 05:08.090
Then won't His Majesty be in danger?

05:08.090 --> 05:11.030
Don't worry. He won't be able to touch him.

05:11.050 --> 05:13.760
You look so composed.

05:14.490 --> 05:17.630
Assassination happens occasionally these years.

05:17.650 --> 05:19.530
I'm used to it.

05:19.650 --> 05:21.440
Occasionally?

05:22.370 --> 05:26.130
Now Nanqing is the most powerful.

05:26.420 --> 05:28.750
Beiqi and Dongyi Town

05:28.770 --> 05:31.680
fear His Majesty deeply.

05:31.700 --> 05:34.440
It's common for them to send assassinators.

05:52.300 --> 05:53.690
It's you!

05:59.540 --> 06:01.000
You really don't know who I am?

06:01.020 --> 06:02.570
Whoever you are,

06:02.610 --> 06:03.370
don't step into

06:03.370 --> 06:05.290
the main hall.

06:07.700 --> 06:10.090
His Majesty is in the Imperial Study.

06:14.260 --> 06:16.920
So His Majesty was the one
who worshipped in the Qing Temple.

06:31.860 --> 06:34.590
The man just died is the assassinator.

06:34.610 --> 06:36.310
I told you

06:36.330 --> 06:38.020
no need to make a fuss.

06:38.020 --> 06:39.130
Eunuch Hou,

06:40.020 --> 06:42.250
who's that man in armor?

06:42.770 --> 06:43.650
That is Gong Dian,

06:43.650 --> 06:46.140
Deputy Director of

06:46.140 --> 06:47.540
Imperial Guards

06:47.540 --> 06:49.290
and Imperial Bodyguard.

06:49.540 --> 06:51.560
Have you met him before?

06:51.580 --> 06:53.370
I hit him by palm at the Qing Temple.

06:53.700 --> 06:56.690
Gong Dian is a martial arts master well above the Eighth Dan.

06:56.740 --> 06:59.720
Mr. Fan, you're really outstanding at such a young age.

06:59.740 --> 07:00.590
Eunuch Hou,

07:00.610 --> 07:01.770
does Gong Dian

07:01.770 --> 07:03.160
have any friends?

07:03.770 --> 07:05.280
Of course he does.

07:05.300 --> 07:06.400
What's wrong?

07:06.420 --> 07:07.650
Then don't they all have to

07:07.650 --> 07:09.030
call him Laogong?
(Laogong is homophone for husband in Chinese.)

07:09.050 --> 07:10.970
He's really good at taking advantage of others!

07:12.740 --> 07:15.960
Mr. Fan, when you go inside,

07:15.980 --> 07:18.000
do remember to keep you head down.

07:18.020 --> 07:19.310
Don't look straight at His Majesty.

07:19.330 --> 07:21.200
Do feel relieved. I understand it all.

07:21.420 --> 07:23.040
Look, you're wrong again.

07:24.240 --> 07:26.560
=Imperial Study=

07:26.580 --> 07:28.090
Mr. Fan, please go inside.

07:52.370 --> 07:53.640
Mr. Fan,

07:53.980 --> 07:56.570
His Majesty asks you to wait here.

07:56.740 --> 07:58.010
OK.

08:30.090 --> 08:31.480
Your Majesty.

08:32.290 --> 08:36.280
Your Majesty, I'm waiting outside.

08:42.850 --> 08:44.080
Your Majesty.

08:46.850 --> 08:48.320
Kneel down.

08:48.340 --> 08:49.440
Where should I kneel?

08:49.460 --> 08:52.120
Your Majesty, should I kneel down?

08:52.140 --> 08:53.650
Do you want to kneel down?

08:54.730 --> 08:56.810
Not really.

09:04.410 --> 09:07.570
Then you don't have to.

09:08.700 --> 09:10.030
Thanks, Your Majesty.

09:10.050 --> 09:12.760
Your Majesty, I wonder

09:12.780 --> 09:13.930
why you ordered to see me today.

09:13.930 --> 09:15.760
Have you seen the assassinator

09:15.780 --> 09:17.370
at the door?

09:17.780 --> 09:19.010
Yes, I have.

09:19.610 --> 09:20.730
But I don't know him.

09:20.730 --> 09:21.960
I have nothing to do with him.

09:23.700 --> 09:28.210
Eunuch Hou, tell him.

09:35.370 --> 09:37.950
The assassinator was from Beiqi.

09:37.970 --> 09:39.880
The first day he arrived in the capital city,

09:39.900 --> 09:41.780
the Investigator's Office reported his name

09:41.780 --> 09:43.800
to His Majesty.

09:43.820 --> 09:45.560
He formed the idea of assassination

09:45.580 --> 09:47.800
in last October.

09:47.820 --> 09:49.020
In the following months,

09:49.020 --> 09:51.900
six people consecutively beat around the bush

09:51.900 --> 09:53.930
and strengthened his conviction.

09:53.930 --> 09:55.930
Finally, he made up his mind

09:55.930 --> 09:58.080
to come to the capital city for assassination.

09:58.100 --> 09:59.560
How can you figure out that?

09:59.580 --> 10:03.840
The six people are secret agents of Nanqing.

10:04.020 --> 10:06.710
Then who sent them?

10:06.730 --> 10:08.390
I gave the order.

10:08.410 --> 10:10.150
The Investigator's Office sent them.

10:10.170 --> 10:11.200
So

10:11.220 --> 10:13.370
Your Majesty planned the assassination yourself.

10:13.370 --> 10:16.960
I've planned to start the war against Beiqi for a long time.

10:17.100 --> 10:18.920
There must be a reason.

10:19.020 --> 10:20.320
So the assassinator

10:20.340 --> 10:22.570
is the reason for sending troops.

10:22.730 --> 10:25.440
It's just too obvious.

10:25.460 --> 10:28.270
However, the assassination
on the Niulan Street just happened.

10:28.290 --> 10:30.120
You killed Cheng Jushu,

10:30.140 --> 10:31.800
and interrogated Si Lili at night.

10:31.820 --> 10:33.760
Beiqi's secret agent lurking in the capital city,

10:33.780 --> 10:35.800
that is a better reason to start war against Beiqi.

10:35.820 --> 10:37.830
By killing the murderer and capturing the secret agent alive,

10:37.850 --> 10:39.030
you've rendered great service to the country.

10:39.050 --> 10:43.600
I'll make you the Chief Musician of
the Court of Imperial Sacrifices.

10:43.780 --> 10:44.470
Which rank?

10:44.490 --> 10:45.690
The eighth rank.

10:46.050 --> 10:47.450
It's not high.

10:48.290 --> 10:49.890
Thank His Majesty for his kindness.

10:50.660 --> 10:53.120
Your Majesty, I should kneel down to thank you.

10:53.140 --> 10:54.350
But you just allowed me

10:54.370 --> 10:55.510
to stand on my feet.

10:55.530 --> 10:56.970
Since it was said by Your Majesty,

10:56.970 --> 10:58.220
I can't disobey it.

10:58.220 --> 11:00.770
So I can't kneel down.

11:04.260 --> 11:07.280
How did Lin Gong die?

11:08.290 --> 11:09.560
I really don't know.

11:09.580 --> 11:11.640
You have the reason to kill him.

11:11.660 --> 11:13.150
I had no enmity against him.

11:13.170 --> 11:14.440
Why should I kill him?

11:14.460 --> 11:18.130
Lin Gong planned the assassination on the Niulan Street.

11:18.780 --> 11:20.470
It was him!

11:20.490 --> 11:22.030
You interrogated Si Lili at night,

11:22.050 --> 11:23.660
but you didn't

11:23.660 --> 11:25.470
even get the name?!

11:25.490 --> 11:26.730
She really said nothing,

11:26.730 --> 11:27.140
Your Majesty!

11:27.140 --> 11:30.160
The Crown Prince has known about this.

11:30.370 --> 11:31.810
He demands to see you.

11:34.370 --> 11:36.370
I'm wronged.

11:37.100 --> 11:39.960
Your Majesty, the Crown Prince requests to see you.

11:43.370 --> 11:45.040
Do you want to see him?

11:49.410 --> 11:50.720
Whatever Your Majesty decides.

12:03.850 --> 12:05.240
Your Highness,

12:05.260 --> 12:07.390
His Majesty is meeting the Chief Musician.

12:07.410 --> 12:09.600
He won't see you today.

12:10.490 --> 12:11.950
The Chief Musician?

12:11.970 --> 12:13.260
His Majesty just made Fan Xian

12:13.260 --> 12:16.210
the Chief Musician of the Court of Imperial Sacrifices.

12:19.930 --> 12:21.290
Thank you, Eunuch Hou.

12:21.290 --> 12:24.010
Your Highness, I'm really flattered.

12:28.700 --> 12:31.130
Your Majesty, I'm leaving.

12:50.370 --> 12:51.640
You Majesty,

12:51.660 --> 12:53.840
the Crown Prince paid the highest respect by kowtowing.

12:54.140 --> 12:56.280
He's always respectful.

12:57.660 --> 12:59.040
Mr. Fan!

13:05.930 --> 13:08.240
Your Majesty, you don't want the Crown Prince to see me?

13:08.260 --> 13:10.840
I don't want to ruin the peace.

13:11.220 --> 13:12.200
When you get out later,

13:12.220 --> 13:13.350
the Crown Prince will ask to see you.

13:13.370 --> 13:14.760
I won't stop him.

13:14.780 --> 13:17.210
You have to deal with him yourself.

13:19.020 --> 13:20.250
Well, Your Majesty,

13:20.780 --> 13:22.510
the Prime Minister also wanted to see me this morning.

13:22.530 --> 13:24.450
Is he also going to blame me?

13:24.900 --> 13:25.970
The Prime Minister originally

13:25.970 --> 13:28.450
disagreed with your marriage to Wan'er.

13:29.050 --> 13:31.880
Now, he might have changed his mind.

13:31.900 --> 13:33.080
Why?

13:35.780 --> 13:37.800
You'll know it

13:37.820 --> 13:39.330
when you see him.

13:40.530 --> 13:42.000
Doesn't the Prime Minister suspect that

13:42.020 --> 13:44.650
I'm related to the death of his second son?

13:45.050 --> 13:47.280
It was a top secret of

13:47.580 --> 13:49.900
the Investigator's Office to capture Si Lili.

13:49.900 --> 13:51.260
Would the Investigator's Office tell it

13:51.260 --> 13:52.240
to the Crown Prince?

13:52.260 --> 13:53.030
No.

13:53.050 --> 13:54.730
Then how did the Crown Prince get the information?

13:54.730 --> 13:56.080
What do you think?

13:56.100 --> 13:57.910
Can it be that someone of the Investigator's Office

13:57.930 --> 14:00.210
had pledged allegiance to the Crown Prince?

14:01.490 --> 14:03.200
Your Majesty, do you want me to investigate it for you

14:03.220 --> 14:05.600
by telling me this implicitly.

14:05.970 --> 14:07.220
You mean

14:07.220 --> 14:10.390
I'm suspecting my own son?

14:10.410 --> 14:11.370
Your Majesty, he's not only your son,

14:11.370 --> 14:13.210
but the Crown Prince.

14:15.820 --> 14:17.470
Escort the Chief Musician out.

14:17.490 --> 14:18.390
Yes.

14:18.410 --> 14:20.040
Chief Musician, this way, please.

14:24.850 --> 14:26.210
Fan Xian.

14:28.530 --> 14:30.720
Since you entered the imperial palace,

14:31.290 --> 14:33.720
you seemed honest and frank,

14:33.820 --> 14:37.650
but every word you said meant something.

14:38.370 --> 14:40.120
Do you want to impress me

14:40.140 --> 14:43.040
as an outspoken official?

14:48.170 --> 14:49.570
Just leave.

15:18.170 --> 15:20.400
His Majesty is really hard to predict.

15:20.460 --> 15:21.440
To be honest,

15:21.460 --> 15:22.780
I wet my back out of fear

15:22.780 --> 15:24.640
for what His Majesty said last.

15:24.660 --> 15:26.270
Mr. Fan,

15:26.290 --> 15:28.390
I just couldn't stop sweating

15:28.410 --> 15:29.800
out of fear

15:29.820 --> 15:31.100
since you

15:31.100 --> 15:33.450
started talking.

15:35.170 --> 15:36.390
In the future,

15:36.410 --> 15:38.780
just mind your words.

15:38.780 --> 15:39.910
Yes. Yes. Yes.

15:39.930 --> 15:42.160
I really should. Let's go.

15:43.460 --> 15:44.900
So in your opinion, who is tipping

15:44.900 --> 15:46.300
the Crown Prince off from the Investigator's Office?

15:46.320 --> 15:48.590
Oh my god.

15:48.700 --> 15:49.970
How dare I

15:49.970 --> 15:51.350
talk about

15:51.370 --> 15:53.810
the Crown Prince?

15:56.900 --> 15:57.780
Just tell me secretly.

15:57.780 --> 15:58.760
I won't tell others.

15:58.780 --> 16:00.780
Then I might as well kneel down.

16:00.780 --> 16:01.460
-Just now... -Fine. Fine. Fine.

16:01.460 --> 16:03.010
I won't ask.

16:03.140 --> 16:04.950
Just stand up!

16:04.970 --> 16:07.330
You're scaring me to death.

16:32.050 --> 16:33.450
What's up?

16:33.930 --> 16:37.210
I want to see His Excellency Zhu Ge,
the Director of the First Division.

16:37.930 --> 16:38.610
Tell me your name.

16:38.610 --> 16:39.260
=Yuan Hongdao, Adviser of Prime Minister Lin Ruofu=

16:39.260 --> 16:40.650
=Yuan Hongdao, Adviser of Prime Minister Lin Ruofu=
Yuan Hongdao.

16:40.850 --> 16:42.080
Wait!

16:42.930 --> 16:45.280
Can I wait inside?

16:48.100 --> 16:49.610
Then I'll have to examine

16:49.610 --> 16:51.330
your personal belongings first.

17:14.500 --> 17:15.910
What are these?

17:15.930 --> 17:17.800
Please tell His Excellency Zhu Ge that

17:18.220 --> 17:19.750
I'm waiting for him here.

17:19.770 --> 17:21.510
Tell me why do you want to

17:21.530 --> 17:23.560
see him first.

17:33.930 --> 17:35.510
If I tell you,

17:35.530 --> 17:38.290
I'm afraid you might lose your life.

17:40.650 --> 17:42.410
You even dare to threaten me!

17:42.650 --> 17:44.530
How dare you!

17:45.890 --> 17:47.200
Don't move.

17:49.820 --> 17:51.130
I won't leave.

17:51.500 --> 17:54.170
Please ask His Excellency Zhu Ge out.

18:10.500 --> 18:12.230
Did you kill Lin Gong?

18:12.250 --> 18:13.480
I didn't.

18:14.050 --> 18:15.320
My tracer friend

18:15.340 --> 18:16.380
and I started off on

18:16.380 --> 18:17.360
the wrong foot.

18:17.380 --> 18:18.440
We wasted so much time that

18:18.460 --> 18:20.010
we didn't even leave the capital city.

18:22.930 --> 18:25.170
You know our family
is in charge of garrisoning the capital city.

18:25.250 --> 18:26.820
It's easy for me to figure out

18:26.820 --> 18:27.560
whether you left the capital city or not.

18:27.580 --> 18:28.930
Go ahead, please.

18:33.580 --> 18:35.080
Luckily, it's not you.

18:35.100 --> 18:35.740
Or I'll also

18:35.740 --> 18:36.340
be responsible

18:36.340 --> 18:37.840
for Wan'er's brother's death.

18:42.890 --> 18:43.630
You don't usually

18:43.650 --> 18:44.990
wear plain clothes.

18:45.010 --> 18:46.290
Where have you been?

18:46.620 --> 18:47.930
The Lin mansion.

18:48.130 --> 18:49.890
I'm checking things out for Wan'er.

18:50.100 --> 18:51.050
It's a pity that Lin Gong's body

18:51.050 --> 18:52.890
is still kept in the Investigator's Office.

18:54.290 --> 18:55.410
I hope the Investigator's Office

18:55.410 --> 18:57.170
can find the really killer.

19:09.980 --> 19:11.320
Why are you here?

19:12.740 --> 19:14.440
Lady Ruoruo was worried at home.

19:14.460 --> 19:16.010
She sent me here to wait for you.

19:16.380 --> 19:17.800
So good you're here.

19:17.820 --> 19:19.720
I'm going to the Prime Minister's mansion.

19:19.860 --> 19:22.080
Please send a word to Ruoruo for me.

19:22.130 --> 19:23.440
What should I tell her?

19:23.580 --> 19:24.340
Ask her to visit the Crown Prince

19:24.340 --> 19:25.510
in the Eastern Palace.

19:25.530 --> 19:27.530
Tell him I'm going to visit the Prime Minister.

19:27.860 --> 19:29.960
Why?

19:30.010 --> 19:31.290
If the Crown Prince really

19:31.290 --> 19:32.890
instigates Lin Gong to kill me,

19:32.890 --> 19:34.220
he surely doesn't want me to

19:34.220 --> 19:36.170
reconcile with the Prime Minister.

19:36.460 --> 19:38.200
He might even come to stop me.

19:38.860 --> 19:41.080
But even if he does come to stop you,

19:41.100 --> 19:43.080
how can it do us good?

19:44.100 --> 19:45.380
If he really comes,

19:45.380 --> 19:46.960
then he's overly concerned about this.

19:46.980 --> 19:48.530
Cunning as the Prime Minister,

19:48.530 --> 19:49.840
he will definitely be suspicious.

19:52.100 --> 19:54.820
Your Excellency, you can also make a cunning fox.

19:54.820 --> 19:55.990
Stop it!

19:56.010 --> 19:57.800
I'm a big-tailed wolf.

19:59.410 --> 20:02.750
What is that?

20:02.770 --> 20:04.720
A mystical creature of ancient times.

20:19.170 --> 20:20.480
How come it's you?

20:22.700 --> 20:24.170
Your Excellency!

20:43.700 --> 20:45.600
Excuse me, may I help you?

20:47.410 --> 20:48.440
I'm Fan Xian.

20:48.460 --> 20:49.580
Earlier today,

20:49.580 --> 20:51.130
the Prime Minister asked to see me.

20:56.010 --> 20:57.480
Brother asked you to tell me this?

20:57.500 --> 20:58.390
Yes.

20:58.410 --> 20:59.130
He went to

20:59.130 --> 21:00.720
the Prime Minister's mansion alone.

21:00.770 --> 21:03.010
According to time, he must have arrived.

21:04.820 --> 21:06.600
OK, Let's go.

21:17.770 --> 21:19.290
Please wait a moment.

21:26.960 --> 21:28.320
=Lin Dabao, eldest Son of Nanqing Prime Minister Lin Ruofu=

21:28.340 --> 21:29.960
Who are you?

21:40.980 --> 21:42.150
Your Highness,

21:42.170 --> 21:43.930
Lady Ruoruo is here.

21:48.930 --> 21:50.410
Fan Ruoruo

21:50.410 --> 21:52.680
pays respects to Your Highness.

21:57.170 --> 21:58.600
Why are you here?

21:58.620 --> 21:59.600
You Highness,

21:59.620 --> 22:01.410
my brother has left the imperial palace.

22:01.410 --> 22:03.930
Now he's in the Prime Minister's mansion.

22:03.930 --> 22:04.990
Go on.

22:05.010 --> 22:06.740
He asked Wang Qinian to pass on the word

22:06.740 --> 22:08.910
that he intended to avoid Your Highness.

22:08.930 --> 22:11.440
And he asked us to cover for him.

22:11.460 --> 22:13.130
If Your Highness leaves now,

22:13.130 --> 22:15.130
you might be able to stop him just in time.

22:16.700 --> 22:18.050
I see.

22:21.380 --> 22:24.480
Your Highness, won't you go to stop him?

22:25.220 --> 22:26.270
No need.

22:26.290 --> 22:27.460
I've told the Prime Minister

22:27.460 --> 22:29.290
everything I know.

22:29.740 --> 22:31.480
Fan Qing is walking right

22:31.500 --> 22:33.720
into the trap.

22:34.890 --> 22:39.170
What will the Prime Minister do?

22:47.380 --> 22:48.770
The Prime Minister

22:48.890 --> 22:52.440
will surely figure out

22:52.650 --> 22:57.840
whether Lin Gong's death is related to Fan Xian or not.

23:31.290 --> 23:32.650
Miss Lili,

23:33.290 --> 23:35.370
it won't take long.

23:35.410 --> 23:36.530
I only need to ask you

23:36.530 --> 23:38.560
one question about Lin Gong.

23:41.500 --> 23:43.840
How was Lin Gong related to me?

23:44.700 --> 23:46.130
No need to cover that up.

23:46.290 --> 23:47.580
Second Young Master Lin Gong planned

23:47.580 --> 23:49.480
the assassination on the Niulan Street.

23:49.580 --> 23:51.370
I've known it all.

23:51.930 --> 23:53.410
Now listen carefully.

23:53.700 --> 23:55.390
My question is

23:55.410 --> 23:56.870
did you tell Fan Xian that

23:56.890 --> 23:58.750
Lin Gong is the real killer

23:58.770 --> 24:01.050
during the night interrogation?

24:06.890 --> 24:08.440
Who are you?

24:09.460 --> 24:12.680
Yuan Hongdao, the adviser of the Prime Minister.

24:13.650 --> 24:15.800
Lin Ruofu sent you to ask me, right?

24:15.820 --> 24:17.560
Please answer me.

24:19.130 --> 24:22.930
No. I didn't tell Fan Xian.

24:24.290 --> 24:25.530
Good.

24:26.890 --> 24:28.170
Next,

24:28.250 --> 24:29.820
I'll test you to see

24:29.820 --> 24:31.320
whether you told the truth or not.

24:34.740 --> 24:35.630
How?

24:35.650 --> 24:37.560
One by one.

24:37.770 --> 24:39.030
At last,

24:39.050 --> 24:40.560
if your answer

24:40.580 --> 24:42.720
remains the same,

24:42.740 --> 24:44.600
then you've told the truth.

24:45.980 --> 24:48.890
Miss Lili, which one do you want to start from?

24:49.460 --> 24:50.960
I told you the truth.

24:51.620 --> 24:53.560
I didn't tell him about Lin Gong.

24:53.580 --> 24:54.250
I can swear.

24:54.250 --> 24:55.150
Be patient. Be patient.

24:55.170 --> 24:56.410
It will only take a while.

25:02.820 --> 25:06.410
It's a bloodstain left years ago. It can't be wiped clean.

25:06.410 --> 25:09.840
No. I really didn't tell him.

25:14.010 --> 25:15.270
No!

25:15.290 --> 25:16.410
No!

25:24.740 --> 25:26.010
This one! This one!

25:26.010 --> 25:26.870
The one below

25:26.890 --> 25:29.050
is Hong.

25:29.250 --> 25:30.930
This one. This one.

25:31.250 --> 25:32.840
This is Fu Ling.

25:33.580 --> 25:35.050
There is another one.

25:35.740 --> 25:36.960
Jin Xiu! Jin Xiu!

25:36.980 --> 25:38.130
Stop feeding it.

25:38.130 --> 25:40.800
It eats the most every time.

25:42.500 --> 25:44.600
-Jin Xiu. -I see.

25:44.620 --> 25:45.840
Stop eating.

25:50.010 --> 25:51.390
What's your name?

25:51.410 --> 25:52.560
I'm Fan Xian.

25:52.980 --> 25:54.530
Fan Xian?

25:55.220 --> 25:57.320
Are you here to see someone?

25:57.890 --> 25:59.170
What's your name?

26:01.770 --> 26:02.930
My dad said

26:02.930 --> 26:04.510
I should be careful with strangers.

26:04.530 --> 26:05.930
I shouldn't tell them easily that

26:05.930 --> 26:07.960
my name is Dabao.

26:10.890 --> 26:11.860
We've talked

26:11.860 --> 26:12.600
for so long.

26:12.620 --> 26:14.290
I'm no stranger to you.

26:16.890 --> 26:18.250
That makes sense.

26:19.050 --> 26:20.650
Then I'll tell you.

26:21.770 --> 26:24.270
My name is Dabao.

26:24.290 --> 26:25.030
What a good name!

26:25.050 --> 26:25.840
Right! Right!

26:25.860 --> 26:28.170
My name is good.

26:28.740 --> 26:30.440
But,

26:30.460 --> 26:31.910
Erbao doesn't like it.

26:31.930 --> 26:33.750
He doesn't like it when I call him Erbao.

26:33.770 --> 26:35.480
Is Erbao your younger brother?

26:37.100 --> 26:38.250
Yes.

26:39.010 --> 26:41.010
How do you know that?

26:42.380 --> 26:44.080
Have you seen him recently?

26:44.100 --> 26:45.750
He hasn't been home all the time.

26:45.770 --> 26:47.370
I miss him.

26:47.620 --> 26:49.220
Does Erbao have another name?

26:49.220 --> 26:50.200
Yes.

26:50.220 --> 26:53.010
He's called Lin Gong.

26:53.290 --> 26:55.390
But, I still feel that

26:55.410 --> 26:58.410
Erbao is better.

26:58.410 --> 26:59.530
Right?

27:02.700 --> 27:04.170
Do you know

27:04.740 --> 27:07.080
when he will come home?

27:07.220 --> 27:09.650
I have so many questions to ask him.

27:18.980 --> 27:20.200
What do you want to ask him?

27:20.220 --> 27:21.440
I'll answer them instead.

27:21.500 --> 27:22.110
Really?

27:22.130 --> 27:22.870
Yes!

27:22.890 --> 27:25.320
I want to ask Erbao

27:25.380 --> 27:25.930
Jin Xiu...

27:25.930 --> 27:27.720
What do I want to ask him?

27:27.740 --> 27:28.380
I want to...

27:28.380 --> 27:29.100
No hurry! No hurry!

27:29.100 --> 27:30.180
Take your time.

27:31.460 --> 27:33.320
I want to ask...

27:33.340 --> 27:35.410
I want to ask him...

27:40.620 --> 27:43.560
Miss Lili, please answer me again.

27:46.930 --> 27:48.290
No.

27:49.820 --> 27:51.800
I didn't tell Fan Xian

27:52.580 --> 27:54.720
about Lin Gong.

27:54.860 --> 27:55.990
Good.

27:56.010 --> 27:58.080
Let's insert the remaining needles

27:58.100 --> 27:59.650
one by one.

27:59.860 --> 28:01.290
Then we'll add something else.

28:09.700 --> 28:10.600
No!

28:10.620 --> 28:11.840
No!

28:12.930 --> 28:14.130
No!

28:14.620 --> 28:16.170
No!

28:16.700 --> 28:18.080
Excuse me.

28:22.250 --> 28:23.800
Mr. Yuan?

28:25.100 --> 28:26.480
Yes, I am.

28:26.500 --> 28:29.150
She's a prison of the Investigator's Office.

28:29.170 --> 28:30.230
Didn't His Excellency Zhu Ge

28:30.250 --> 28:32.030
tell you?

28:32.050 --> 28:33.170
I did.

28:33.740 --> 28:36.050
The Prime Minister has obtained

28:36.100 --> 28:37.800
His Majesty's verbal instruction
to ask Si Lili some questions.

28:37.820 --> 28:39.370
Your Excellency, don't you believe me?

28:40.290 --> 28:41.530
I believe you.

28:41.860 --> 28:43.600
But according to the verbal instruction,

28:43.620 --> 28:45.480
you're supposed to ask her

28:45.500 --> 28:48.110
instead of torturing her.

28:48.130 --> 28:50.720
You've made a point.

28:50.740 --> 28:52.560
Mr. Yuan, have you finished asking?

28:52.890 --> 28:57.010
Sort of.

28:58.980 --> 29:00.200
Then, I'll see you out.

29:00.220 --> 29:01.410
Fine.

29:04.740 --> 29:06.440
Mister,

29:09.170 --> 29:10.800
you stuff.

29:11.620 --> 29:13.680
Miss, you can keep it as a souvenir.

29:32.500 --> 29:34.320
No, thanks.

29:56.380 --> 29:58.320
Your Highness, you don't have to.

30:05.890 --> 30:07.930
The tea is good.

30:12.460 --> 30:15.250
It was a gift from Lin Gong.

30:16.820 --> 30:22.270
He used to talk to me

30:22.290 --> 30:24.370
about everything.

30:25.930 --> 30:28.010
I had long heard that the Second Young Master

30:28.100 --> 30:29.890
was a follower of Your Highness.

30:30.100 --> 30:32.080
In your opinion,

30:32.530 --> 30:33.820
should I figure out

30:33.820 --> 30:35.750
how he was killed?

30:35.770 --> 30:37.440
Your Highness, who do you suspect?

30:40.340 --> 30:43.200
That morning when Lin Gong left the capital city,

30:43.220 --> 30:44.530
he had visited me.

30:45.130 --> 30:47.480
We talked about what happened
in the capital city those days.

30:47.500 --> 30:48.620
I mentioned that

30:48.620 --> 30:51.390
Fan Xian had captured Si Lili in person

30:51.410 --> 30:53.110
and interrogated Si Lili at night

30:53.130 --> 30:56.010
in order to mislead the real killer.

30:56.050 --> 30:57.110
And then?

30:57.130 --> 30:59.650
Then he changed color

31:00.460 --> 31:01.870
and told me

31:01.890 --> 31:06.250
he was the one who planned the assassination
on the Niulan Street.

31:07.620 --> 31:09.230
He wanted to kill my brother?

31:09.250 --> 31:10.230
Why?

31:10.250 --> 31:11.800
I don't know, either.

31:11.860 --> 31:13.980
He was worried that Fan Xian might found out

31:13.980 --> 31:15.960
his relationship with Si Lili,

31:15.980 --> 31:17.960
so he decided to leave the capital city on the very day

31:17.980 --> 31:19.700
and came back when the whole thing is over.

31:19.700 --> 31:21.600
I just didn't know that

31:21.620 --> 31:24.250
it might be the last time I saw him.

31:29.820 --> 31:31.530
Your Highness,

31:33.380 --> 31:35.680
do you suspect that my brother killed him?

31:35.700 --> 31:37.530
If confirmed that Si Lili

31:37.530 --> 31:39.480
ratted out Lin Gong's name to Fan Xian,

31:39.500 --> 31:42.930
Fan Xian has the motive to kill him.

31:43.860 --> 31:44.650
Your Highness, why don't you ask

31:44.650 --> 31:46.480
Si Lili in person?

31:47.340 --> 31:48.650
I've told all my doubts

31:48.650 --> 31:50.410
to the Prime Minister.

31:50.700 --> 31:52.130
As Lin Gong's father,

31:52.250 --> 31:54.010
it's more appropriate for him

31:54.010 --> 31:55.600
to ask Si Lili.

31:55.930 --> 31:58.130
We can just wait for the news.

32:05.100 --> 32:06.770
The tea is really good!

32:11.770 --> 32:14.560
I know you want to protect the Fan family.

32:14.580 --> 32:16.250
If Fan Xian really did it,

32:16.250 --> 32:18.080
I'll only kill him.

32:19.290 --> 32:21.320
The Fan family won't be involved.

32:25.530 --> 32:27.200
Thank you, Your Highness.

32:53.340 --> 32:54.650
Your Excellency.

32:58.500 --> 33:00.800
Have you seen Si Lili?

33:01.050 --> 33:03.250
Yes, I've seen her and asked her.

33:03.930 --> 33:04.620
She didn't tell Fan Xian that

33:04.620 --> 33:05.980
the Second Young Master

33:05.980 --> 33:07.410
planned the assassination.

33:07.500 --> 33:09.080
Did she tell the truth?

33:09.100 --> 33:10.560
I used some tricks,

33:10.580 --> 33:12.130
and she didn't change her words.

33:13.860 --> 33:15.480
In your opinion,

33:16.340 --> 33:18.800
why didn't she tell Fan Xian?

33:18.820 --> 33:20.480
A lot of people are involved.

33:21.220 --> 33:22.700
She might want to

33:22.700 --> 33:24.480
trade the secret for her life.

33:24.700 --> 33:26.230
Moreover, when Fan Xian interrogated her,

33:26.250 --> 33:27.650
he was not a government official.

33:27.860 --> 33:29.720
It makes sense that she didn't tell him.

33:31.290 --> 33:34.290
If Fan Xian didn't know about this,

33:35.220 --> 33:37.410
then he has no motive to kill Gong'er.

33:37.500 --> 33:38.770
Exactly.

33:40.700 --> 33:43.600
Mr. Yuan, please go to the Eastern Palace

33:43.620 --> 33:46.510
and inform the Crown Prince of the result.

33:46.530 --> 33:47.720
It's my duty.

33:47.740 --> 33:48.840
Moreover,

33:48.860 --> 33:50.650
as to Fan Xian,

33:51.170 --> 33:53.720
please send a word

33:54.100 --> 33:55.960
to the Crown Prince for me.

33:56.460 --> 33:58.010
Your Excellency, I'm listening.

33:59.100 --> 34:01.600
Why is the sky blue?

34:02.460 --> 34:04.320
Because the ocean is blue.

34:05.380 --> 34:07.480
Why is the ocean blue?

34:08.250 --> 34:10.800
The sun shines into the ocean,

34:10.820 --> 34:12.650
so the ocean becomes blue.

34:12.940 --> 34:14.320
Then tell me.

34:14.820 --> 34:15.940
Why isn't the water

34:15.940 --> 34:17.650
in the pond blue?

34:17.820 --> 34:19.450
Because the pond water is too shallow.

34:19.620 --> 34:21.450
So it is!

34:21.820 --> 34:23.240
Shallow water doesn't appear to be blue.

34:23.530 --> 34:24.840
Mr. Yuan, good day.

34:24.860 --> 34:26.560
Good day, Dabao.

34:27.100 --> 34:29.230
Mr. Fan, you're really learned.

34:29.250 --> 34:30.450
So admirable!

34:30.450 --> 34:31.600
I'm just talking nonsense.

34:31.620 --> 34:33.000
Please don't take it seriously.

34:34.290 --> 34:36.170
The Prime Minister is waiting for you in the study.

34:40.050 --> 34:41.100
Where's the study?

34:41.100 --> 34:42.100
I know.

34:42.100 --> 34:43.840
I'll take you there. Let's go.

34:45.180 --> 34:46.490
Dad!

34:47.770 --> 34:48.970
Dad!

34:49.010 --> 34:51.320
I've brought Fan Xian to you.

34:56.040 --> 34:57.550
=Lin Ruofu, Prime Minister of Nanqing=

34:57.690 --> 34:58.930
Dabao,

34:59.050 --> 35:00.750
play outside for a while.

35:00.770 --> 35:02.600
I need a word with him.

35:03.820 --> 35:04.970
Dad,

35:05.660 --> 35:08.730
when will Erbao come home?

35:20.010 --> 35:22.930
Dad, then Dabao will go out.

35:25.940 --> 35:29.930
Dabao had a disease when he was little.

35:30.290 --> 35:32.470
He turned into this after he was recovered.

35:32.490 --> 35:34.230
Having grown up physically,

35:34.250 --> 35:38.080
he's still a kid mentally.

35:40.660 --> 35:43.800
Wan'er can't go back home all the time,

35:44.010 --> 35:45.890
and she's sick with tuberculosis.

35:47.940 --> 35:50.280
Thanks for your treatment,

35:50.420 --> 35:54.040
she is recovering day by day.

35:54.100 --> 35:55.320
It's what I should do.

35:59.530 --> 36:02.210
The future of the Lin family

36:02.690 --> 36:04.280
lied entirely on

36:04.530 --> 36:06.690
Gong'er before.

36:06.860 --> 36:09.000
Shouldering the responsibility of

36:09.140 --> 36:10.210
inheriting the Lin family

36:10.210 --> 36:12.600
since childhood,

36:12.940 --> 36:14.510
he never felt happy,

36:14.530 --> 36:17.000
=All the birds will go to the forest=
but he never complained

36:17.690 --> 36:20.080
the hardship or suffering.

36:20.210 --> 36:22.600
This was written by him when he was little.

36:23.180 --> 36:24.360
Back then,

36:24.380 --> 36:25.950
I often told him that

36:25.970 --> 36:29.430
the civil and military officials of the Six Ministries

36:29.450 --> 36:31.170
are like flocks of birds,

36:31.770 --> 36:34.690
clamoring and quarreling without a stop.

36:36.940 --> 36:38.690
In order to ensure

36:39.380 --> 36:42.000
continuous family inheritance,

36:42.490 --> 36:45.600
we must stick to our roots

36:45.620 --> 36:47.930
among the chaotic birds.

36:48.140 --> 36:50.080
All the birds will go to the forest (Lins).

36:51.290 --> 36:54.030
The Second Young Master wanted to make
a permanent place for the Lin family

36:54.050 --> 36:55.650
in the imperial court.

36:56.820 --> 36:59.560
Though the handwriting is poor,

36:59.820 --> 37:02.000
it shows ambition.

37:02.660 --> 37:04.370
But it sounds arrogant and conceited.

37:05.010 --> 37:08.450
It's common for young people.

37:11.970 --> 37:16.130
These are also written by him when he was little.

37:20.180 --> 37:22.270
Even his handwriting in childhood

37:22.290 --> 37:24.130
is much better than mine.

37:26.420 --> 37:29.120
Since I became an official,

37:29.140 --> 37:31.130
I've gone through three ups and three downs.

37:31.580 --> 37:34.170
Even when I was locked in the death row,

37:35.180 --> 37:37.370
I never felt desperate.

37:38.340 --> 37:40.040
Until I heard of his death

37:41.820 --> 37:44.210
last night.

37:47.730 --> 37:52.560
Gong'er is the one who planned
the assassination on Niulan Street.

37:54.730 --> 37:56.450
How could it be him?

38:07.210 --> 38:09.170
Prime Minister, you want to kill me!

38:13.490 --> 38:14.420
I don't know

38:14.420 --> 38:16.370
how I offended you!

38:16.690 --> 38:19.560
It seems you really don't know this.

38:22.660 --> 38:24.520
It's not me who wants to kill you.

38:24.970 --> 38:26.370
He kept the whole thing

38:26.900 --> 38:28.800
from me.

38:29.010 --> 38:29.660
Well.

38:29.660 --> 38:30.710
Then why did the Second Young Master

38:30.730 --> 38:32.450
want to kill me?

38:32.620 --> 38:33.890
I didn't know anything about it

38:35.340 --> 38:36.530
until the Crown Prince sent someone

38:36.530 --> 38:38.890
to tell me this morning.

38:39.820 --> 38:41.320
Is the Crown Prince...

38:43.340 --> 38:44.970
It doesn't matter anymore.

38:46.210 --> 38:47.360
You should marry Wan'er

38:47.380 --> 38:49.650
as soon as possible.

38:55.820 --> 38:57.840
In the future, I'll try my best

38:57.970 --> 38:59.840
to promote you in the officialdom.

38:59.860 --> 39:01.930
The Guo family hates you

39:02.620 --> 39:04.490
for beating Guo Baokun.

39:04.770 --> 39:06.600
I'll protect you from them.

39:06.620 --> 39:09.470
It doesn't matter you're not recorded

39:09.490 --> 39:11.320
in the genealogy of the Fan family.

39:11.380 --> 39:14.670
In the future, all the properties

39:14.690 --> 39:17.040
and connections of the Lin family will be handed over to you.

39:17.530 --> 39:21.120
Your Excellency, I still don't get it.

39:21.140 --> 39:23.490
All these are based on

39:24.660 --> 39:26.690
one condition.

39:33.250 --> 39:34.190
Please tell me.

39:34.210 --> 39:35.970
After I die,

39:37.140 --> 39:40.040
you must protect Wan'er and Dabao,

39:40.180 --> 39:42.600
and protect the Lin family

39:42.620 --> 39:44.890
from political enemies.

39:45.290 --> 39:46.930
Give me your promise,

39:47.180 --> 39:48.430
and the Lin family

39:48.450 --> 39:50.880
will be the strongest support for you

39:50.900 --> 39:52.930
in the capital city.

40:03.660 --> 40:07.210
It's not for trade.

40:10.690 --> 40:12.560
You actually refused me!

40:13.420 --> 40:16.930
I didn't refuse you. It's just not for trade.

40:17.010 --> 40:19.370
Wan'er and I fell in love at first sight.

40:19.490 --> 40:21.270
After meeting and talking with her over and over again,

40:21.290 --> 40:23.210
I've already put her in my heart.

40:23.620 --> 40:24.990
If I marry her,

40:25.010 --> 40:26.320
it's my responsibility

40:26.340 --> 40:27.930
to love her and protect her.

40:28.100 --> 40:29.640
If I marry her,

40:29.660 --> 40:31.800
I'm related to the Lin family by blood.

40:31.940 --> 40:34.160
It's my duty to protect the Lin family

40:34.180 --> 40:36.040
and take care of Dabao.

40:36.660 --> 40:37.800
If I marry her,

40:37.820 --> 40:39.920
it's because she wants to marry me for love,

40:39.940 --> 40:41.760
not for a trade.

40:46.690 --> 40:49.560
Your Excellency, I'm willing to do

40:49.580 --> 40:51.280
everything you've said just now,

40:51.450 --> 40:53.600
only because I have her in my heart.

41:08.420 --> 41:10.890
So you met and talked with my daughter

41:11.100 --> 41:14.030
over and over again?

41:14.050 --> 41:15.640
When did you meet?

41:15.660 --> 41:17.080
How did you meet?

41:22.250 --> 41:23.450
Your Excellency,

41:24.140 --> 41:25.900
that's not

41:25.900 --> 41:27.450
the point.

41:29.420 --> 41:31.320
Then I'll see myself out.

41:36.900 --> 41:37.710
Your Highness,

41:37.730 --> 41:39.100
Yuan Hongdao from the Prime Minister's mansion

41:39.100 --> 41:40.560
requests to see you.

41:40.580 --> 41:43.370
He's come at the right moment. Here comes the news.

41:47.730 --> 41:49.210
Yuan Hongdao pays respects to Your Highness.

41:50.970 --> 41:52.890
Did the Prime Minister send you here?

41:53.970 --> 41:56.400
The Prime Minister had me interrogate Si Lili

41:56.420 --> 41:58.240
in the Investigator's Office.

42:01.380 --> 42:02.600
What's the result?

42:02.860 --> 42:04.600
Si Lili didn't tell Fan Xian

42:04.620 --> 42:07.130
about the Second Young Master.

42:09.970 --> 42:11.160
Your Highness,

42:11.180 --> 42:13.560
the Prime Minister asked me to send a message.

42:13.580 --> 42:15.230
From today on,

42:15.250 --> 42:17.600
Fan Xian shall be regarded as
the son-in-law of the Lin family.

42:17.620 --> 42:20.190
Let bygones be bygones.

42:20.210 --> 42:21.530
In the future, he hopes that

42:21.530 --> 42:23.520
Your Highness can pardon Fan Xian

42:23.660 --> 42:26.370
for being rude for his sake.

42:27.820 --> 42:30.470
Does the Prime Minister think I'm the one
who wants to kill Fan Xian?

42:30.490 --> 42:34.280
I don't know what the Prime Minister thinks.

43:03.000 --> 43:06.580
In the river of history,

43:06.600 --> 43:10.070
time goes round and round.

43:12.880 --> 43:16.220
Memories about the former and present lives

43:16.240 --> 43:20.310
join each other in an endless way.

43:22.200 --> 43:24.820
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:24.840 --> 43:27.080
one season follows another in a flash,

43:27.080 --> 43:29.580
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:29.600 --> 43:31.200
I just can't give up

43:31.200 --> 43:34.540
to be with you for my whole life.

43:34.560 --> 43:40.030
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:41.280 --> 43:43.830
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:44.120 --> 43:46.160
Year after year in the wandering,

43:46.160 --> 43:48.820
I count the remaining years.

43:48.840 --> 43:51.020
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

43:51.040 --> 43:53.030
even though we have ended up the destiny,

43:53.320 --> 43:55.710
I never feel regretful.

43:55.760 --> 43:57.120
In such a chaotic world,

43:57.120 --> 44:00.100
I still miss you as ever.

44:00.120 --> 44:03.070
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:03.360 --> 44:05.420
With a gentle heart,

44:05.440 --> 44:08.100
I cherish our remaining years.

44:08.120 --> 44:09.640
Even though we have to go through

44:09.640 --> 44:12.150
all the hardships along the journey,

44:12.280 --> 44:19.470
you always stay by my side,

44:19.560 --> 44:22.230
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:22.520 --> 44:24.600
Year after year in the wandering,

44:24.600 --> 44:27.260
I count the remaining years.

44:27.280 --> 44:29.420
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:29.440 --> 44:31.670
even though we end up the destiny,

44:31.880 --> 44:34.060
I never feel regretful.

44:34.080 --> 44:35.480
In such a chaotic world,

44:35.480 --> 44:38.540
I still miss you as ever.

44:38.560 --> 44:41.670
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:41.760 --> 44:43.900
With a gentle heart,

44:43.920 --> 44:46.620
I cherish our remaining years.

44:46.640 --> 44:48.080
Even though we have to go through

44:48.080 --> 44:50.740
all the hardships along the journey,

44:50.760 --> 44:59.520
you always stay by my side...
